WEBVTT

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:04.940
School Rumble is starting now!

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:07.770
My name is Tsukamoto Tenma.

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.320
The person I like is Karasuma Ooji, who is in the same class.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.110
My name is Harima Kenji.

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:14.320
The person I like is Tsukamoto Tenma, who is in the same class.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.830
Ah! But...

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:21.330
Why does Karasuma have to transfer to another school after the third term?

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:24.960
Tenma-chan has no idea about my feelings for her.

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.420
Now it's the third semester.

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:30.800
This kind of thing is for sure!

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:34.090
Something like this.

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:37.010
Even though something similar happened.

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:42.950
But... in the end our feelings...

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:44.310
were not received.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.270
Because I like you, Harima-san.

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:53.150
So today is our third term's last important event, the walkathon.

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:56.320
But on that day I...

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.280
I am going to America.

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:01.010
Heard that Karasuma was going to America.

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:02.160
This is the last chance.

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:04.120
I'll do my best!

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:08.330
Thinking this was my chance, I left for the jungles of Angola!

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:11.190
Although I miraculously escaped and returned,

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:14.760
Everyone misunderstood again, and thought that Tenma's younger sister and I were madly in love.

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:21.220
In the end, Tenma even begged me to allow her to be alone with Karasuma.

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:23.180
Are you okay?

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:25.020
It doesn't hurt at all.

00:01:25.590 --> 00:01:29.480
I've been rejected without even confessing...

00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:30.990
Tenma-chan.

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:35.440
Am I really just going to watch helplessly while you and Karasuma walk to the goal together?

00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:44.370
Finally, I can be alone with Karasuma.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:46.830
I have to tell him quickly.

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:51.000
Karasuma-kun. Umm... I...

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.250
Actually I...

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:55.970
Ladies and gentleman!

00:01:57.010 --> 00:02:01.180
Yes! Finally! This stupid marathon is nearing the end!

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:03.640
Let's run! Everyone!

00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:08.560
Sweating together, let's head toward this year's final dawn!

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:10.520
GO!!

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:15.190
Let's run too.

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:18.150
Eh...ok...

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:48.290
Receive! My feelings!

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:48.290
Shatter! My feelings!

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:48.290
Full speed ahead for love!

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:53.000
Tsukamoto Tenma, I always wanted

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:53.000
to tell you these feelings...

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:58.210
Harima Kenji, will it end

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:58.210
before you can tell her your feelings?

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:08.240
What should I do? This isn’t the right time to confess.

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:11.520
But if this goes on, the walkathon will be over.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:14.020
I won't have this chance again.

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:17.860
Oh! Just do it!

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:23.680
Ka-Karasuma-kun. Ac-Actually I...

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:25.530
Karasuma-kun, I...

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:29.080
What!? Karasuma-kun!

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.540
When did you run so far ahead?!

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:39.670
Um.. Listen to me... Actually I...

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:41.420
Karasuma-kun, I...

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:44.380
What!? Again? When did he get so far ahead!

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:51.130
Wait! Karasuma-kun! Karasuma-kun!

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:53.810
Um... Karasuma-kun, I...

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:02.780
Why? Why? Why!?

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:04.240
Why does it always turn out this way?

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:09.740
I won't admit defeat!

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:13.180
Karasuma-kun! Karasuma-kun!

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:16.770
I...I...

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:33.080
So, up until the very end, I still couldn't do it.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:37.120
It made me understand that, no matter how hard you try, some things are always out of reach.

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:40.790
Goodbye, Karasuma-kun.

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:50.250
Tsukamoto-san.

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:03.860
This is the world's most beautiful dawn.

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:07.720
Karasuma-kun, I...

00:06:19.010 --> 00:06:21.590
While one person is confessing,

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:23.110
Another is dumped at the same time.

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:25.740
Harima Kenji.

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:29.370
Ah it’s Harima. What is he doing?

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:31.620
Who knows? Maybe even after being dumped,

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:36.670
he still thought that a miracle would happen, so he came back.

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:39.100
Only to find it was impossible in the end.

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:41.130
Damnit!

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:43.440
Although I've been dumped,

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:46.100
Acting depressed, and even asking for kindness,

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:49.060
The world will not give such a thing.

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:50.300
Harima Kenji.

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:54.290
I'm going back. I'm not going to participate in this class activity.

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:55.810
Ah he ran away.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:57.220
Harima-san, wait...

00:06:57.630 --> 00:07:00.290
Do you think it'll work out, Yakumo-chan?

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:02.000
He has lingering affections.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:05.440
This is horrible. I wouldn’t have ever accepted it.

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:07.670
Wait up, Harima.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:11.880
You have a responsibility to participate until the end.

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:14.320
What did you say? Mr. four-eyes.

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:17.620
Don't upset Yakumo anymore.

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:18.790
What kind of man are you?

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:21.710
Another guy who can’t forget his past love.

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:24.380
Do you really think this is ok, Mikoto?

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.250
What has it got to do with me?

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.900
I’m just saying; I don't like to be ordered around by you.

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:30.580
Go away.

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:33.150
No! This is a problem that a man must settle.

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:34.800
Do you want a showdown?

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:37.420
If you think you are capable, beat me to the finish line.

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:39.980
If you do, I'll be satisfied.

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:41.730
Although it’s not even possible.

00:07:43.340 --> 00:07:45.230
Interesting, I'll play with you.

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:47.730
So let the battle begin.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:51.240
Don't think you're invisible. I'll make you cry after.

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:53.030
If you have the power to do so, sure.

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:54.910
Ready.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:55.780
Go.

00:07:57.680 --> 00:07:58.830
Bye-bye!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:03.330
I'm going to kill you!

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:06.080
Catch up to me if you can, you old man!

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:08.080
Such a fast pace!

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:09.590
The joys of being young.

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:13.160
Harima-san looks rejuvenated.

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:15.740
Nee-san?

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:18.690
Lost them.

00:08:26.570 --> 00:08:28.080
Goal!

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:31.350
2C is the best!

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:33.650
Yes! I can finally enter Toudai University!

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:34.580
Goal!

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:35.780
You worked hard right?

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:38.270
Where did Tsukamoto go?

00:08:40.090 --> 00:08:41.400
There she is.

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:43.040
Tsukamoto!

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:45.760
How is everything? Oi~

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:47.230
It hurts~

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:48.460
Tell us the news...

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:08.250
You're pretty good, Harima.

00:09:08.850 --> 00:09:11.260
To think that I... couldn't catch up.

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:13.120
Look at you!

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:21.160
Even if it is 5 centimeters, a win... is a win!

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:26.650
Time to go before seeing something that I dread.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:28.590
Harima-san.

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:31.340
What’s wrong, imouto-san?

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:34.550
Nee-san, she... and Karasuma-san...

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.670
What the hell?

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:43.670
We can't find Karasuma-san anywhere.

00:09:44.070 --> 00:09:46.570
He might already have left for the airport.

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:48.600
Harima-san?

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:51.520
It can't be. The airport? That guy...

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:54.950
Itoko! Lend me your car.

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:55.880
I don't have one.

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:05.620
Karasuma!

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:10.040
Bastard!

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:16.770
You filthy bastard!

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:52.910
Imouto-san already told me everything.

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:55.170
Who do you think you are?

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:57.520
I see.

00:10:57.520 --> 00:10:59.480
It is not "I see." !

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:02.500
What is wrong with you? Bastard!

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:05.140
Are you really alive?

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:07.890
I don't understand at all!

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:09.670
Listen up!

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:12.920
The girl that you toyed around with,

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:16.400
also has someone that is in love with her. Do you know that? Bastard?!

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:19.900
Love her all your life!

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:26.830
You are pretty proud.

00:11:27.260 --> 00:11:30.790
What? You can fight pretty well.

00:11:31.340 --> 00:11:34.570
If I could take out my frustration on you,

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:35.960
then I'd do it.

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:41.470
Eh, Karasuma-kun?

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:42.720
Yeah.

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:53.400
In order for me to take the operation in America, I have to take the early flight in the morning.

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:55.960
I won't be able to see you guys after that.

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:00.130
I can't help it.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:06.070
Did Karasuma say that?

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:09.070
Um... Please keep it a secret.

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:12.180
You're right, he wouldn't want others to know.

00:12:12.180 --> 00:12:16.840
Leaving quietly on his own sounds like something he would do.

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:19.800
But he’s too naive.

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:22.960
How can we watch idly?

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:24.470
Hang on, Tenma.

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:25.800
Takano.

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:27.960
Yeah, that’s right.

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:30.060
Do you already have a plan?

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:31.680
Reliable as always!

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:38.630
You don't have one do you!?

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:40.650
What happened to you?!

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:43.600
But, we don't really have a choice now.

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:47.660
But, We should still let them meet once more.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:53.430
Tsuakamoto. Um...

00:12:57.140 --> 00:13:00.710
I got lost in the beautiful memory of this school year~

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:05.300
There’s still next year. I'm finally going to be a final year student.

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:09.330
What the? It looks like she’s fine now.

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:10.760
It may look that way...

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:15.670
Tenma, Karasuma-kun...

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:20.000
I wonder if I'll be able to get into the same school as Miko-chan.

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:22.070
Hold on...

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:24.530
She’s totally not facing up to reality.

00:13:25.210 --> 00:13:26.700
Most people are like this.

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:28.000
Tenma.

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:33.410
Eri-chan is going to get a home tutor before taking the university exams.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:34.940
What are you saying?

00:13:34.940 --> 00:13:37.670
Don’t you want to see Karasuma again?

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:41.910
No...it’s fine.

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:43.340
It feels like...

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:46.350
You know, since it was him who decided it.

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:49.420
If I pursue it any further, he'll find it annoying.

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:50.890
This matter has been resolved.

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:55.830
So, it’s best to let go, and start thinking about what to do next!

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:57.710
Something new and interesting!

00:13:57.710 --> 00:13:59.020
I need to do them all!

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:03.860
There might still be a chance. Aren’t you going to fight for it?

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:06.160
That’s true for Eri-chan.

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:08.790
In your case, all the guys swayed so easily.

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:10.730
But not for me.

00:14:10.730 --> 00:14:11.820
I’m just a normal girl.

00:14:12.570 --> 00:14:16.300
I feel timid at times too.

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:19.150
I found someone who is very precious to me.

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:21.390
But we had to part so suddenly.

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:26.470
Do you know this kind of feeling?

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:30.320
My mind is a blank.

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:34.560
Can't I?

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:38.520
So I can only think of this.

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:43.740
I'm the only one who believes that the future will be brighter.

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:51.910
Bastard.

00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:15.930
Cuffs?

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:20.640
You must be tired of running away too.

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:23.100
I'm going to hit you until you cry.

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:30.530
It was a really good event!

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:33.140
I want to thank you all again.

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:36.480
Don't stand on ceremony with us Sensei.

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:40.500
We were once young too.

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:43.750
Yeah, even though we usually did foolish things,

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:47.250
The last event was always the most fun.

00:15:47.560 --> 00:15:49.400
That means the men's finishing line is still up ahead?

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:50.290
What?

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:55.300
Tani-sensei, Harima-kun told me to tell you that he borrowed your bicycle.

00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:58.240
But I still have the keys...

00:15:58.240 --> 00:16:00.700
I guess he has to pay for a new lock now.

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:02.520
That idiot.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:07.620
Even if you are sick,

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:09.900
I will not go easy on you, bastard.

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:14.920
I don't like adjusting to the situation,

00:16:14.920 --> 00:16:16.890
or settling things peacefully.

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:19.480
You can rest easy.

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:21.390
After I beat the crap out of you, I will go look for Tsukamoto.

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:26.250
I will not let her be led on by trash like you anymore!

00:16:31.310 --> 00:16:32.550
This person...!

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:36.470
I apologize for being gutless!

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:40.140
I apologize for having no self-confidence!

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:44.350
But this involves being with a girl for her whole life.

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:48.390
Of course I have to think about whether or not I can give her happiness throughout her life.

00:16:48.390 --> 00:16:50.820
I can't just think about myself!

00:16:51.230 --> 00:16:53.780
I like Tsukamoto-san too!

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:58.320
Shut up! If you're a man, prove it with your actions!

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:14.090
Feh! I'm not interested anymore.

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:19.110
But I think I understand now.

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:24.060
Why you always kept silent. Why you never complained.

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:27.380
It's because you didn't want it to look like you were making excuses.

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:29.070
So you can't forgive yourself.

00:17:30.700 --> 00:17:33.700
Even in death, you don't want to blame it on anyone else.

00:17:34.390 --> 00:17:36.450
You are a stubborn guy too

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:38.680
I can rest easy now.

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:41.700
But from now on, it will be a man's battle.

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:44.240
I'm going to see Tsukamoto now.

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:46.310
Go.

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:50.290
If it is you, you'll be able to make her happy.

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:52.360
I think you definitely can do it.

00:17:53.270 --> 00:17:55.590
I never thought I would be this indignant,

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:59.330
But if I really like her,

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:02.560
I have no choice but to watch over her happiness.

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:08.680
Someone like you, who doesn't know how to retaliate, will die to someone else sooner or later.

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:12.020
Someone like that can't even protect a girl, and does not deserve any sympathy.

00:18:12.890 --> 00:18:15.910
But your retaliation just now was pretty good.

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:17.800
It's really frustrating.

00:18:21.940 --> 00:18:27.560
Maybe we should stop Karasuma from leaving.

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:28.500
How could we...

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:32.710
I'm sure Karasuma-san is in a dilemma too.

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:34.900
But he's not able to do anything.

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:37.000
Isn't that an excuse men give to run away?

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:39.300
If this carries on, you will be in trouble too.

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:41.050
Is that so..?

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:44.000
Now what shall we do for the rest of the day?

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:48.430
If it’s possible, I want everyone to go over to your place.

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:52.630
But I don't know if nee-san is still in the mood for that.

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:54.270
True.

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:58.770
Let’s drink for the whole day!

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:02.160
24 hour endurance battle!

00:19:08.110 --> 00:19:09.840
That was fast!

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:11.360
Tenma, you can hold your liquor pretty well!

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:14.550
Is Tenma actually more mature than we thought?

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:20.040
Tch! That person actually took a taxi to the airport.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:23.110
Ugh! The chain completely broke.

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:25.600
Forget it! It is Tani-san's after all.

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.000
That hurts.

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:35.570
How could I not drink after all that?

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:40.260
I ... really liked him! You know that?

00:19:40.260 --> 00:19:44.020
I liked him more than everything in the world.

00:19:44.020 --> 00:19:46.530
But I got dumped so easily.

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:49.700
What should I do?!

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:55.530
No matter how we tried to make the mood better, it didn’t help in the end.

00:19:55.530 --> 00:19:57.570
She couldn't hold in her pent-up feelings after all.

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:01.130
More like, how did she become like this just from drinking soda?

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:02.010
Forget about it.

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:07.470
If you think about it calmly, he's just a typical guy.

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:09.560
Find someone better.

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:11.920
I won't allow you to talk bad about Karasuma-kun!

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:12.940
What the hell are you thinking?

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:16.160
It must be painful to have such an illness.

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:19.640
When you find out you are not fit to love someone.

00:20:19.640 --> 00:20:21.940
I can understand the feeling of wanting to leave without saying anything.

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:26.300
But he does like you!

00:20:26.300 --> 00:20:30.620
It's better than having some girl snatch him away.

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:32.220
Are you trying to console her?

00:20:32.220 --> 00:20:36.260
I'm just saying it would have been more frustrating if some girl snatched him away!

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:37.380
Because you would have been totally rejected then.

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:39.650
I have heard that line at least a hundred times.

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:41.380
What a lively conversation...

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:44.340
Yes! Drink it up Miko-chin!

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:47.600
Okay!

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:49.860
I feel sorry for Hanai-kun.

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:52.080
This has nothing to do with him!

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:55.310
But you've been repeating that since a while ago.

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:03.150
Harima-san.

00:21:04.340 --> 00:21:05.880
Is your sister in?

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:13.040
Tsukamoto, I have something to tell you. Come with me.

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:16.540
If it isn't Harima-kun~

00:21:17.230 --> 00:21:21.220
Come and sit beside us! Let me tell you...

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:26.120
What are you doing? Did you mix up the two Tsukamotos?

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:28.180
That’s right!

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:31.830
At least I can wish that Harima-kun and Yakumo will be happy together in the future!

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:32.970
As the elder sister,

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:38.450
Nothing in this world can stop the two of you.

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:40.010
Nothing of that sort Tsukamoto!

00:21:40.010 --> 00:21:43.940
There might be something good happening for you too!

00:21:43.940 --> 00:21:46.820
Something good? No way!

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:50.360
Something that is better than finding love...

00:21:50.360 --> 00:21:52.160
... is to conquer the world.

00:21:53.090 --> 00:21:55.720
Sorry for making you worry about me.

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:59.630
Looks like nee-san is going to have a hard time finding happiness.

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:04.160
The person who likes you more than anything is standing in front of you.

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:05.590
My words will definitely...

00:22:06.490 --> 00:22:09.550
Maybe my feelings for you seem broken.

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:12.190
But when I see you like this,

00:22:12.190 --> 00:22:14.650
I feel so angry at myself for being useless.

00:22:15.320 --> 00:22:17.250
The one who did not make their feelings known was myself.

00:22:17.640 --> 00:22:19.520
For someone like me...

00:22:19.520 --> 00:22:23.060
I don't know of any other way to make someone else happy.

00:22:25.430 --> 00:22:27.070
If I really like her.

00:22:27.070 --> 00:22:28.460
I can't do anything but watch over her happiness.

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:33.780
Fool. Everyone is a fool!

00:22:34.940 --> 00:22:37.290
Can't even do something simple like this.

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:39.520
Who says I'm unlucky?

00:22:39.520 --> 00:22:40.260
Tsukamoto.

00:22:42.300 --> 00:22:45.000
I will make you happy.

00:22:49.860 --> 00:22:53.770
Although it might make me look insensitive saying such a thing at this point of time.

00:22:54.170 --> 00:22:55.390
I still have to say it.

00:22:55.900 --> 00:22:56.850
Come with me!

00:23:01.890 --> 00:23:05.460
Tsukamoto's been abducted!

00:23:10.540 --> 00:23:12.740
Harima-kun, where are you taking me?

00:23:12.740 --> 00:23:14.160
You're making me feel uneasy.

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:16.160
Don't talk, or you'll bite your tongue!

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:20.250
We are going to the airport.

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:22.310
Ehhh!?

00:24:46.900 --> 00:24:49.440
I must tell you

00:24:49.440 --> 00:24:53.200
It's because of you that I am happy

00:24:53.860 --> 00:24:56.200
I must tell you

00:24:57.740 --> 00:25:00.850
Next episode School Rumble Third Term - Final Episode.

00:25:00.850 --> 00:25:05.830
Even when I'm old and have no hair,

00:25:00.850 --> 00:25:05.830
will you still think of me as necessary?

00:25:05.830 --> 00:25:10.860
Even if I turn 64 years old,

00:25:05.830 --> 00:25:10.860
Forever, you are mine...
